                  "blocks": {
                    "txt_features": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li><strong>Fully Waterproof Shell</strong><br/>Keeps you dry in heavy rain. Sealed construction for wet-weather cycling and running.</li><li><strong>360° Retroreflective Panels</strong><br/>Large reflective areas on front, back, and arms visible from all angles in headlights.</li><li><strong>Fluorescent Hi-Vis Yellow</strong><br/>UV-reactive fabric for strong daytime conspicuity in traffic and low-contrast conditions.</li><li><strong>Helmet-Compatible Hood</strong><br/>Adjustable fit over a cycling helmet with a ducktail peak for rain protection.</li><li><strong>Pit Vents and Rear Vents</strong><br/>Breathable airflow channels that prevent overheating during hard efforts.</li><li><strong>Packable Design</strong><br/>Folds into its own rear pocket. Compact enough for a jersey pocket or bag.</li><li><strong>Sizes S, M, L, XL, 2XL</strong><br/>Designed for men and women. Size chart shown in images.</li></ul>",
