          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_DGQQJN": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How waterproof and breathable is this jacket?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_YKcirp": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The current RT-JA rain jacket uses fabric rated at 15,000 mm waterproof and 9,000 g/m²/24h breathability. Those specifications apply to the RT-JA jacket family, not older discontinued ReflecToes jackets.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_YKcirp"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_BN79F4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will it vent during hard riding or running?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_rCydwH": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. The jacket has pit vents and rear ventilation to move heat and moisture, plus a helmet-compatible hood. It also packs into its rear pocket when the weather clears.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_rCydwH"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_VMFKax": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How should I wash the rain jacket?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_VJwfQy": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Hand wash it in cold water and hang dry. Do not use fabric softener, harsh detergent, bleach, or an iron on the technical and reflective materials.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_VJwfQy"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_hXCKMe": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How fast will my order ship?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_LGAUJr": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Orders are typically processed within one business day and ship from St. George, Utah. U.S. Ground Advantage is $5.99 on orders under $50 and free on orders of $50 or more. Ground Advantage is usually 3 to 5 business days after shipment. Tracking is emailed when the order ships.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_LGAUJr"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_aCqYAj": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What if I need to return or exchange it?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_WVPFzD": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>You can request a return within 30 days after delivery. Contact <a href=\"mailto:info@reflectoes.com\">info@reflectoes.com</a> before sending it back. Approved U.S. returns receive a prepaid label. For a size exchange, the fastest option is usually to return the original item and place a new order.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
